averon{"id":791,"date":"2023-01-26T14:45:37","date_gmt":"2023-01-26T14:45:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/learning\/networking\/"},"modified":"2023-03-27T18:11:03","modified_gmt":"2023-03-27T18:11:03","slug":"networking","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/learning-hub\/networking\/","title":{"rendered":"Networking"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Bringing our business community together<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Nebula Trust is connected to many companies, industries, non-profits, municipalities and more. We\u2019re working to bring our customers and others together through professional networking groups and events. We want to share the talent and knowledge present in our business community to help lift every organization to new heights.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-4 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Networking-women-in-business.png\" alt=\"A woman sitting at a table using a laptop smiles at the camera with four people in the background\" class=\"wp-image-2710\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Women in Business<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Join the Forte Women\u2019s Club to learn from and collaborate with other women business owners and driven women across many industries. Access networking opportunities, event programming, banking resources and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/learning-hub\/networking\/women-in-business\/\">LEARN MORE<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-7 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-top is-style-info-block\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-style-center-vertical\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem;flex-basis:75%\">\n<h2>Business Book Club<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Leadership comes in many forms, we can be leaders of self, leaders of teams, or leaders of organizations. In our Business Book Club, we focus on books that expand our minds, teach us something new in the ways of business, management and relationship-building, and push us to become better leaders. This book club meet 4 times a year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Interested in reading with us? Email Miria Gray at <a href=\"mailto:mgray@chelseagroton.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mgray@chelseagroton.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Networking-book-club.png\" alt=\"A smiling man in blue shakes the hand of an older woman in grey with three smiling people in the background watching\" class=\"wp-image-2712\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Bringing our business community together Nebula Trust is connected to many companies, industries, non-profits, municipalities and more. We\u2019re working to bring our customers and others together through professional networking groups and events. We want to share the talent and knowledge present in our business community to help lift every organization to new heights.&nbsp; Women in&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_medi